</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1282619">
<problem id="fs-id1584354">
<para id="fs-id1359302">જ્યારે <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> ત્યારે કિંમત શોધો:

<list id="eip-id1168468312802" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>−9</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:math></item>

